  "title": "Braised BBQ Pulled Pork",
  "description": "This easy-to-prepare, tangy, delicious pulled pork recipe braises pork tenderloin in a spicy-sweet BBQ sauce — it is perfect when feeding a crowd.",
  "authors": [
    "kashmirkat"
  ],
